                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:24px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">202</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:24px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:24px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年新年献词</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:24px"><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span></span><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 24px"><span style="font-family:宋体">携手共奋进，同向新未来</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 华文楷体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:华文楷体">绍兴一中党委书记、校长</span>   <span style="font-family:华文楷体">王</span><span style="font-family:华文楷体">琛</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-align:center"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">20</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">22</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">.12.31</span></span></p><p><span style=";font-family:Calibri;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">日月其迈，时盛岁新</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在这辞旧迎新的时刻</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，我谨代表学校</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">党委和行政班子</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">向全体一中学子</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">和</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">家长、教职员工，向</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学校</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">离退休老同志，向海内外</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">所有</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一中校友，向长期关心和帮助我们事业发展的各级领导、校友</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">会</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">基金会爱心人士、社会各界朋友，致以</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">最诚挚的问候、最衷心的感谢和最美好的祝愿！</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2022</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">是落实</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“十四五”规划的关键一年，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">是极不寻常的一年。一年来，全体一中人克服疫情困难，以团结拼搏、实干担当的踏实行动，共同谱写了一中教育高水平发展的新篇章。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们以实际行动献礼庆祝党的二十大胜利召开</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。全校上下认真学习宣传贯彻党的二十大精神，全面落实党的教育方针和习近平总书记关于教育的重要论述，落实省市两级党代会精神，精心筹备并成功召开学校党委换届大会，选举产生新一届党委班子，确定了学校发展思路，党建引领与思想政治工作不断加强，立德树人的决心更加坚定，改革发展的路径更加明确，打造</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“全国一流江南名校”的共识更加凝聚。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们聚焦教育改革，推进高质量发展成效显著。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">以</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“四个转型”为改革目标，稳步推进“八大中心”“三大智能化支持平台”建设，学校发展取得了可喜的成绩：被绍兴市委、市政府表彰为“绍兴市改革开放创新发展突出贡献奖”先进集体；继首批“浙江省文明校园”、首批“浙江省现代化学校”后，又成功创建为浙江省首批“清廉学校”建设示范校；德育工作再获市先进，实现三连优；年度考核再获第一，实现三连冠。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">党建、德育、数字校园、安全、劳动、心理、卫生、环保等各线块工作均有新提升，再次实现市级和市直属级先进荣誉全覆盖。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们致力</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">高考竞赛</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">深耕</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，教学业绩再上新台阶。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">天文奥赛再夺</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">枚</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">国际金牌，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">国际金牌数</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">金</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，全省领先</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。本年度，学校共获全国竞赛金牌</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">12</span><span style="font-family:宋体">枚，入选国家集训队</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，全国联赛省级赛共获一等奖</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">60</span><span style="font-family:宋体">个，在创历史新高同时，首次实现了五大联赛均有省一等奖全覆盖良好态势。</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2022</span><span style="font-family:宋体">届高考</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">690</span><span style="font-family:宋体">分以上</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6</span><span style="font-family:宋体">人，全市第一；特控线上线率</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">C9</span><span style="font-family:宋体">名校录取</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">人数均</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">创新高</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，均实现三年连升</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">位学生成为</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">空军飞行学员，取得历史性突破。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们推进</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">教科研平台搭建，队伍建设提升新水准。</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本年度，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">张洁慧</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">老师获</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“全国五一劳动奖章”，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">蔡红</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">老师新评正高、特级，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">金建忠等</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">18</span><span style="font-family:宋体">位老师获得“省春蚕奖”“省教科研先进个人”“省实验技能大赛一等奖”“市劳动模范”“市最美教师”“市担当好干部”“市拔尖人才”“市优质课一等奖”等省市两级</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">重要</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">荣誉。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">范捷等</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span><span style="font-family:宋体">位老师成为省市党代表、人大代表和政协委员。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在市直优质课评比中，我校有</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">12</span><span style="font-family:宋体">门学科获市直优质课一等奖。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">继数学、生物两教研组后，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">英语、化学教研组</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">再</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">获</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“浙江省先进教研组”</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">荣誉</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们重视</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">博雅</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">学子全面培养，</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为国争光树</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">新</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">榜样</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。本年度，以</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">蒋裕燕、朱毅轩、周泽震等同学</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">杰出代表</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">的</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一中学子</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">国际赛场</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">上</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">拼搏</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">夺</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">冠，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">科技竞赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中登顶摘金</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为国争光，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">激励着广大一中人踔厉奋发、勇毅前进。蒋裕燕作为游泳选手，在残奥会、全国残运会打破多项世界记录，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">荣</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">记省政府一等功，获全国</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“青年五四奖章”；朱毅轩仰望星空，勇摘天文奥赛国际金牌，获浙江省“新时代好少年”；周泽震用镜头记录浩瀚星空，拍摄《仙女座星系：邻居》勇夺</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2022</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年天文摄影大赛青年组世界冠军，受到人民日报、央视新闻及各级主流媒体的持续报道，他还受邀参加腾讯大会，和美国天体物理学家、诺贝尔物理学奖得主约翰·马瑟展开了一场</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">60</span><span style="font-family:宋体">多分钟的线上“隔屏”对话。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">我们</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">创优</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">枫桥式平安校园</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">众志成城同心战</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“疫”</span></span></strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">全校师生顾全大局、令行禁止，认真落实国家和省市区的防疫政策，形成了一道坚强有力而又暖人心扉的一中风景。关键时刻，党员干部站得出、顶得上、靠得住，教职员工顾大局、讲奉献、心连心，一中学子不怕苦、不畏难、有担当，通过组织丰富的校本化安全教育活动，提高安全教育科学性和实效性，创优美丽校园的温馨度和安全感，共同交出了一份</span><span style="font-family:宋体">“教育共富”赶考路上的良好答卷。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">每一项成绩的</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">取得</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">，无不浸染着每位</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">一中</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">人的智慧与汗水</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">奉献与耕耘</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">；也</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">离不开各级领导的关心</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">与</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">指导，全体家长</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">校友</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">和社会各界的理解</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">与</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">支持。</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">回首波澜壮阔的这一年，我们心怀感恩，充满力量！</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2022</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年，我们历经考验，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">于困难中淬炼坚强，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">在辛勤</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">中绘就属于我们的</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">精彩。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2023</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">新的曙光照耀，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">有许多美好梦想值得我们奋力拼搏创造，还会有不少挑战等待我们</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">齐心</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">攻坚克难。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">时光</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">从不辜负</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">奋斗者</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。让我们迎着新年的</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">曙光勇毅</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">前行，瞻望前程锦绣，</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">携手共赴未来</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"><span style="font-family:宋体">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:37px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:19px"> </span></p><p>
</p>
    
